                          "description": {
                            "value": "Each creature in the area becomes drowsy, possibly nodding off. A creature that falls unconscious from this spell doesn't fall prone or release what it's holding. This spell doesn't prevent creatures from waking up due to a successful Perception check, limiting its utility in combat.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes a \u20131 status penalty to Perception checks for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The creature falls unconscious. If it's still unconscious after 1 minute, it wakes up automatically.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature falls unconscious. If it's still unconscious after 1 hour, it wakes up automatically."
                          },
                          "higher_level_description": {
